.Dd May 29, 2026
.Dt ZDOTS 7
.Os zdots
.Sh NAME
.Nm zdots
.Nd observable zsh control plane
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Zdots is a modular zsh environment that combines shell startup, local AI,
OpenTelemetry, command analytics, and a PostgreSQL knowledge layer.
.Sh PRIMARY LOOPS
.Bl -enum
.It
Shell emits traces and state.
.It
Services expose live status.
.It
Knowledge tools capture and hydrate context.
.It
Documentation contracts compare written interfaces with live behavior.
.El
.Sh TRUTH SURFACES
.Bl -tag -width "agent-guide --json"
.It Li zdots-ctl status --json
Live service uptime.
.It Li capabilities --json
Environment capability contract.
.It Li agent-guide --json
Agent usage map.
.It Li docs/generated/interface-inventory.json
Documented command inventory.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr capabilities 1 ,
.Xr zdots-ctl 8 ,
.Xr zdots-env 5
